      "description": "Koupon is a free coupon and deals app that finds verified promo codes, discounts, and price drops across Amazon, Walmart, eBay, Best Buy, Macy's and Woot, and tests every code before you see it.\n\nIf you're seeking daily deals, promo codes, or coupons for the brands and stores you already shop, Koupon brings them into one place and checks them so you don't have to. \n\nHOW WE VERIFY EVERY CODE \nMost coupon apps list codes nobody has tested. Koupon checks each one twice. Our system tests the code automatically, confirming it works, what discount it gives, and which products it applies to. Our editors then review what the system found and catch what automation can't: misleading terms, regional limits, and deals that are technically valid but not worth your time. A code only goes live when both agree.\n\nVerification doesn't stop at publishing. Every live deal is monitored, re-checked on a regular schedule, and flagged or removed when it stops working. Our systems process over 10 million verification checks every day. Each deal shows when it was last verified, so you always know how fresh it is. Spot a code that failed? Tap Report on any deal page and it goes straight into our verification queue. \n\nDAILY DEALS, DISCOUNTS & PRICE DROPS \nNew deals land every day. Seek deals by discount percentage, price drop, or category, and check the discount history and deal quality before you buy. Set alerts for all-time lows, flash sales, and trending products so the best prices reach you first. \n\nCOUPONS FOR YOUR FAVORITE BRANDS \nBrowse verified coupons and deals for over 3000 brands, including Apple, Samsung, Nike, Dyson, LEGO, Sony, KitchenAid, and Stanley. Follow the brands you love and never miss a markdown. \n\nSHOP BY CATEGORY \nFind savings across every category you shop: \n- Electronics: laptops, TVs, headphones, smart home \n- Fashion: clothing, shoes, bags, jewelry \n- Home & Kitchen: appliances, furniture, bedding, cookware \n- Beauty & Health: skincare, makeup, vitamins, personal care \n- Baby, Pet, Toys, Sports & Outdoors, Grocery, Automotive, and more\n\nBLACK FRIDAY, PRIME DAY & SEASONAL SALES \nWhen the big sales hit, Koupon tracks them live: Black Friday, Cyber Monday, Amazon Prime Day, Back to School, and the holiday season. Get the verified codes and lowest prices as they drop, not the day after.\n\nAMAZON, WALMART, EBAY & MORE \nOne search covers Amazon, Walmart, eBay, Best Buy, and Woot. Compare deals across stores without opening five apps. \n\nYOUR CHECKOUT STAYS WITH THE RETAILER \nApply codes directly at the retailer's checkout. Your purchase and payment happen on the retailer's site, and Koupon never processes your payment. Koupon earns a commission on some purchases, which never changes the price you pay or the deals we show you.\n\nJoin 20 million shoppers saving with Koupon. Rated 4.9 with over 5 Million Downloads. \n\nDownload Koupon and start saving today!",
